## How this campaign would work

1. **Confirm the recipient.** Before the campaign uses the name of a fire company, CMAX Foundation confirms it with the institution. Until then, this page shows the campaign as proposed.
2. **Open the campaign.** The number of units, the estimated cost and the delivery plan are published once confirmed. This first version of the site does not process payments; supporters contact the Foundation through the form.
3. **Deliver and document.** When the goal is met, the Foundation coordinates the delivery, holds a handling exercise with the crews, and publishes the record under Our Actions.

## Why AeroCabin™

The proposed response is described on the [AeroCabin™ page](/our-work/aerocabin). It is presented as a proposed capability: the campaign would include a demonstration with the receiving crews before any figures about performance are published.
